.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK WORK LABEL REMOVE"
.SH NAME
hamstik work label remove \- Detach a label from a work item
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik work label remove [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Detach a label from a work item
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I KEY
Work item key
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --label
Label id (UUID) or label name
.TP
.B --force
Bypass revision conflict protection (If-Match: *)
Choices: true, false
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Explicit idempotency key
